&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;1985年２月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;東京証券取引所市場第一部に上場。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:12.8pt;min-height:12.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;2002年４月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;東レエンジニアリング㈱、村田機械㈱と合弁でティエムティマシナリー㈱(現 ＴＭＴマシナリー㈱)を設立。2003年４月合繊機械事業を同社に移管。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;1992年４月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2.5pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;社名を㈱ナブコと改称。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:37.5pt;min-height:37.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;2003年10月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:4pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;社名をティーエスコーポレーション㈱と改称。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;1999年10月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;乗用車用オイルブレーキ事業をボッシュ ブレーキ システム㈱(現 ボッシュ㈱)に譲渡。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:24.8pt;min-height:24.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;2004年10月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:6pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;ナブテスコ㈱に吸収合併されたことにより消滅。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;2004年10月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:6pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;ナブテスコ㈱に吸収合併されたことにより消滅。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
