&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:43pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-22.5pt;"&gt;(注) 当期間における取得自己株式には、2024年３月１日から有価証券報告書提出日までの単元未満株式の買取りによる株式は含めていません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:8pt;font-size:8pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:8pt;font-size:8pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:8pt;font-size:8pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DisposalsOrHoldingOfAcquiredTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:13.5pt;"&gt;(4) 【取得自己株式の処理状況及び保有状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:8pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:15pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:468pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:166pt;min-width:166pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:75.5pt;min-width:75.5pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:75.5pt;min-width:75.5pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:75.5pt;min-width:75.5pt;"/&gt;
