&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:21.5pt;padding-right:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;(2) 内部統制報告書及び&lt;br/&gt;その添付書類&lt;/p&gt;
